SQL> -- The vocabulary application code checks. Handlers call road_ctx.require_permission('events.purge'),
SQL> -- never require_role -- because permissions are what make role composition a data change rather
SQL> -- than a release (spec-patch-06 section 6.1).
SQL> -- is_reserved marks a permission whose composition is framework- or application-owned rather than
